{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:00.10]Enviyon on the mix\n[00:04.50]No, no, no, no\n[00:07.46]No-no, no, no, no\n[00:12.52]No, no, no, no, no\n[00:18.60]No, no, no, no\n[Chorus]\n[00:23.40]I still see your shadows in my room\n[00:26.06]Can't take back the love that I gave you\n[00:28.78]It's to the point where I love and I hate you\n[00:31.36]And I cannot change you, so I must replace you, oh\n[00:35.08]Easier said than done, I thought you were the one\n[00:37.86]Listenin' to my heart instead of my head\n[00:40.76]You found another one, but I am the better one\n[00:43.54]I won't let you forget me\n[00:46.26]I still see your shadows in my room\n[00:48.92]Can't take back the love that I gave you\n[00:51.62]It's to the point where I love and I hate you\n[00:54.16]And I cannot change you, so I must replace you, oh\n[00:57.94]Easier said than done, I thought you were the one\n[01:00.72]Listenin' to my heart instead of my head\n[01:03.62]You found another one, but I am the better one\n[01:06.32]I won't let you forget me\n[Verse]\n[01:08.62]You left me falling and landing inside my grave\n[01:14.62]I know that you want me dead\n[01:20.34]I take prescriptions to make me feel a-okay\n[01:26.04]I know it's all in my head\n[01:31.78]I have these lucid dreams where I can't move a thing\n[01:37.14]Thinking of you in my bed\n[01:42.86]You were my everything\n[01:45.70]Thoughts of a wedding ring\n[01:48.58]Now I'm just better off dead (Uh, uh, uh)\n[01:54.38]I'll do it over again\n[01:55.92]I didn't want it to end\n[01:57.34]I watch it blow in the wind\n[01:58.78]I should've listened to my friends\n[02:00.46]Leave this shit in the past, but I want it to last\n[02:03.22]You were made outta plastic, fake\n[02:05.82]I was tangled up in your drastic ways\n[02:08.58]Who knew evil girls had the prettiest face?\n[02:11.46]You gave me a heart that was full of mistakes\n[02:14.40]I gave you my heart and you made heartbreak\n[Bridge]\n[02:17.14]You made my heart break\n[02:20.00]You made my heart a